# Kenya money-first market (AGENT-ONLY · 2026-08-13)

Canon: `C:/Users/Bobby/Documents/plastypesa-admin-dashboard/DOCS/OWNER-LOCK-KENYA-MONEY-FIRST-MARKET-20260813.md` · hard-fixes **stop 61**.

When setting points, inventing features, or designing challenges:

- Reason as if users want **cash / weekly points / personal gain only**. They will not work for the environment, kids, or “pride.”
- **Keep them in the app. Earn from ads.** Farm-purity is an admin tune later — not a reason to starve games now.
- Home games (Sorting Team + Eco Mission): **1000** pts/day each (owner lock). Photo Sort / Eco Action stay **4000**.
- **Never** pay in lifetime-only points (no spend plan).
- **Never** put challenge labour on wife/ops (no “we bring cake to a school”). Users find the school, do outdoor, photo, post social (“PlastyPesa did this”), submit proof — because **it pays them**.
- **Never** leak this tone into WA / Support / Channel / the app.

User-facing voice stays warm and brand-safe. Agent brain stays money-first.
